<title>USA: Sigma Designs CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Sigma Designs CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sigma Designs said Q. Bin Trinh resigned as vice president of finance and chief financial officer, secretary and director.</p>
<p>It said he resigned to due personal reasons concerning his own health and that of his terminally-ill sister and &quot;is in no way related to any disagreements with the company's management or Board of Directors or to the company's operations, policies, practices or business prospects.&quot;</p>
</text>
